From: User-3090 <71881005+User-3090@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 13:50:01 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 17/23] fix(client): preserve Local startup errors during saved
 federation

Validate running Local endpoints even with saved machines enabled. Retain startup/connect/handshake diagnostics in transient startup data and the existing notice owner, keep Local notices visible across projection changes, and never freeze healthy remote presentation for a Local attention event. Preserve normal restored selection and standalone failure.

Refs herdrdev/herdr#3759.
